<title>USA: Sharper Image same-store sales off 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sharper Image same-store sales off 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharper Image Corp Thursday reported sales for October and the first nine months of its fiscal year.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$14.6	$14.9	  -2	  -10</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $118.0     $123.4	  -4	   -7</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
